===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*legʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|leyen}}, {{m|enm|leggen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|leċġan|t=to lay}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*laggjan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*lagjaną||to lay}}, causative form of {{inh|en|gem-pro|*ligjaną|t=to lie, recline}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*legʰ-|t=to lie, recline}}.

Cognate with {{cog|fy|lizze||to lay, to lie}}, {{cog|nl|leggen||to lay}}, {{cog|de|legen||to lay}}, {{cog|nb|legge||to lay}}, {{cog|nn|leggja||to lay}}, {{cog|sv|lägga||to lay}}, {{cog|is|leggja||to lay}}, {{cog|sq|lag||troop, band, war encampment}}.

